<title>USA: Global Industrial COO Mielke steps down.</title>
<headline>Global Industrial COO Mielke steps down.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Industrial Technologies Inc said on Wednesday that Donald Mielke resigned as president and chief operating officer, and his duties were assumed by J.L. Jackson, the chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Mielke will remain with the company for several months to help with the transition and to complete various projects.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
